    "title": "Read a member's savings balance",
    "description": "Logs into the Meridian Credit Union core banking system, searches for a member using the supplied member ID, opens the member detail screen, locates the primary Savings account, and returns the current balance of that account. The operation is read‑only and does not modify any data."
  },
  "app": {
